From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 09:11:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/18] win32u: Add Material 3 window frames.

With the Material 3 desktop style, non-client areas are painted as a
flat title bar in the scheme's surface colors, with the title in Roboto
Medium and anti-aliased caption button glyphs. The close button turns
to the error color when pressed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
